'''Zahira''' is a shop [[NPC]] in [[Startorch Academy (Region)|Startorch Academy]]. She is a member of the [[Roya Tribe]] and runs a shop in the [[Royan Market]]. Although she is banned from Academy grounds, her [[Aluna|mech deer]] is not.

