==Dialogue==
{{Dialogue Start}}
:{{DIcon|Grocery}} Buy ingredients
::'''Zahira:''' ...Yes, I hear your call. You seek something... something to help you.
:;(Purchase something)
::'''Zahira:''' Here, take it. It has answered your call.
:{{DIcon}} Chat
::'''{{Rover}}:''' The Royan girl before you reaches out her hand, waiting for your response. {{sic}}
::'''Zahira:''' Like this, we don't need words. Our minds may speak in silent tongues.
::'''Zahira:''' Most thoughts flutter like morning birds. Bright, restless... like my sister [[Aluna]]. Perhaps you know her.
::'''Zahira:''' But some minds... they are like a storm on the horizon. Dark, unsettling.
::{{DIcon}} What are my thoughts like?
::'''Zahira:''' Yours... are different.
::'''Zahira:''' Pure white. Still, as if they have  seen the turning of many lifetimes.
::Grrrr...
::{{DIcon}} Abby?!
::'''Zahira:''' ...It seems that within that quiet, there is a quiet hunger.
::'''Zahira:''' This is for you, and the friend who dwells within—
::{{DIcon}} This is...?
::'''Zahira:''' My specially made Gravlaks. No one in the Academy has tasted my cooking, save for Aluna.
::{{DIcon}} Abby, Abby, wake up—
::'''Abby:''' AHHHH! This smells soooo good! Finally, not just cans and toothpaste! Save some for me!
::'''Zahira:''' Once, "fortunate" was I to taste the Academy's famed "super food."
::{{DIcon}} And what did you think?
::'''Zahira:''' Enough to turn morning birds into a restless storm.
:{{DIcon|Duel}} Invite to a duel
:{{DIcon|Exit}} Leave
{{Dialogue End}}

==Trivia==
* Gravlaks is a Nordic Dish that consist of cured salmon in salt, sugar and dill. It is commonly served cold-smoked after curing.

